# Estudo Geral thesis PDFs — the .md extracts + manifest.json under
# estudo_geral/ ARE committed (provenance), the source PDFs are not. Dead
# since S3: the PDF cache moved to paths.estudo_geral_pdf_cache_dir() (the
# app's data dir), so estudo_geral/pdfs/ is never written anymore. Left here
# rather than removed, in case an older checkout still has the directory.
estudo_geral/pdfs/

# ui/dist IS committed: the release workflow runs tests only, never
# `npm run build`, so a gitignored bundle means the installed app points at a
# file that does not exist and its whole frontend silently vanishes.
!ui/dist/
